In order to prepare for the GDPR we will ...

- [x] ... stop saving nationality and gender;
- [x] ... send an e-mail twice a year with the current contact details and ask if the user wants to update them;
- [x] ... remove the user provided study history;
- [x] ... persistently save the study (history) provided by the UT.

When done, we also need to update the privacy policy.
